:: Castle Crypt

# The Old Crypts

You descend into the crypts beneath the Keep. The air grows colder with each step. Green light pulses from below, casting eerie shadows on the stone walls.

At the bottom, you find a large underground chamber. In the center is a rift -- a tear in reality itself, pulsing with green energy. This is the breach that Roderick wrote about. The source of the curse.

<<if $has_amulet>>
The amulet in your possession resonates with the breach. You can feel it pulling toward the rift -- it wants to be used. To seal the breach. Or to widen it.

[[Use the amulet to seal the breach|Final Confrontation]]
[[Retreat for now|Castle Ruins]]
<<else>>
Without the amulet, there's nothing you can do here. The breach pulses, indifferent to your presence. You need the Amulet of Thornwood -- it's somewhere in the forest shrine.

[[Retreat to the ruins|Castle Ruins]]
<</if>>
